chicht.", "en": "I have the early shift."}, {"de": "Haben Sie Spätschicht?", "en": "Do you have the late shift?"}, {"de": "Meine Schicht ist von sieben bis fünfzehn Uhr.", "en": "My shift is from seven to fifteen."}]}, {"t": "story", "lines": ["Now, a real conversation."]}, {"t": "chat", "who": "Kollegin", "goal": "Say your shift type and hours.", "turns": [{"en": "Do you have the early shift today?", "opts": [{"de": "Ja, Frühschicht.", "en": "Yes, early shift.", "ok": true}, {"de": "Tschüss!", "en": "Bye!"}], "them": "Haben Sie heute Frühschicht?"}, {"en": "And until when?", "mode": "choice", "opts": [{"de": "Von sieben bis fünfzehn Uhr.", "en": "From seven to fifteen."}, {"de": "Ich weiß nicht.", "en": "I don't know."}], "them": "Und bis wann?"}, {"en": "Good, see you then!", "mode": "choice", "opts": [{"de": "Bis dann!", "en": "See you then!"}, {"de": "Tschüss!", "en": "Bye!"}], "them": "Gut, bis dann!"}], "avatar": "🌅"}], "teaches": [["Frühschicht", "early shift", "🌅"], ["Spätschicht", "late shift", "🌇"], ["von", "from", "➡️"], ["bis", "until", "🏁"]]}]	a1	live	\N	\N
